#45019
cortex uniform seller quartermaster outfitter shopkeeper~
the `wCortex quartermaster`x~
A `wCortex quartermaster`x with `Rred respirator lenses`x stands behind the uniform counter.
~
The quartermaster wears a flared `wcharcoal-black helmet`x above two round,
`Rglowing red lenses`x. A sculpted `wgunmetal respirator`x hides the lower face,
its ribbed `ggray-green hose`x curling down to a canister on the chest harness.
Broad, overlapping `wslate-gray pauldrons`x give the shoulders a heavy silhouette
above a fitted cuirass and a high-collared `wcharcoal field coat`x. Pale scuffs
pick out the armor's edges, while `ydull brass braid`x loops around one upper
arm. Articulated gauntlets rest on the counter beside neatly stacked uniforms;
a small `Wsilver CORTEX badge`x catches the light at the throat.
~
