clothing 0 AB
-1
98801 112 0 0 0 0
100 5 15 3500 100 0
E
all royal blue gold academy school uniform blazer~
This `Broyal blue`x wool blazer has long sleeves ending at the wrists and a
tailored body reaching the waist. `YGold`x piping follows the low lapels,
cuffs, and hem. The lapels leave the neck visible above a buttoned front,
which can be opened over the chest. A Cortex Academy badge sits on the
breast pocket. Smooth lining covers the back and arms, allowing the blazer
to fit over a school shirt and sweater without hiding a tie at the throat.`x
~
