E
all royal blue gold academy school uniform trousers pants~
Tailored from `Broyal blue`x wool, these straight-cut trousers sit at the
waist and fall to the ankles. A narrow `Ygold`x stripe runs down each outer
seam. The seat and thighs have room for movement, and belt loops and
practical hip pockets keep the finish simple. A buttoned waistband and
zipped front fly secure the trousers; the hems leave the feet free for socks
and shoes. A small Cortex Academy label is stitched inside.`x
~
