all cortex uniform charcoal black field coat jacket brass braid~
Heavy `wcharcoal-black cloth`x forms a high-collared field coat, tailored close
through the ribs before falling into split skirts over the thighs. `gFaded
olive seams`x outline reinforced elbows and deep utility pockets. A loop of
`ydull brass shoulder braid`x rests around the upper arm, and a `Wsilver CORTEX
tab`x sits at the throat. The flat front and shoulder loops fit neatly beneath
a cuirass and its broad pauldrons. A concealed front zip opens the collar,
chest, and lap while the sleeves, back, and side skirts stay in place.`x
